{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0efff88e9d61251399be0481f87edfbe0fafe957d08f4843b4dfc85ed34b6b08", "ja": "収録が長引き、真と歩がレッスンに参加でき\nない事態に。代わりに雪歩が、新しい振り付\nけを覚えてふたりに教えると名乗り出る。決\n死の覚悟で挑む雪歩。あずさと可奈の協力も\nあり、無事にその役割を果たした。", "zh": "真与步因为录影时间延长而无法参加训练，\n雪步面对这个意外状况，\n自愿先学会新舞步再负责教会两人。\n她抱着必死的觉悟接下挑战，\n并在梓与可奈的协助下顺利完成任务。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "62f66c915d4d514c1e251314eff7aed0d314f4fa3204336359943f025180738f", "ja": "（今日は真と歩がローカルTVの音楽番組の収録中だ。\n収録後、BIRTHのレッスンに合流予定だったが……）", "zh": "（今天真与步去地方电视台录音乐节目，\n原定结束录影后要一起参加『BIRTH』的训练……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4828ce01aebadf935b7ed9d7ce19d11eed65c986953a1104840ee051aafb1fd7", "ja": "ええっ！？\n収録が長引いて、レッスンに来られそうにない！？", "zh": "什么！？\n录影时间拉长，可能赶不上训练！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a7e8ea5e778b14e9125e972942a3f77e84343887b1de5200c022745fd9a62573", "ja": "そうなんだよ～～ごめん、{$P$}！", "zh": "就是啊～～抱歉，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "9aeb1ab46c5c62f31e2f417a7a4cdedbe5c972c17c2e72d28f833b0b1673c9e8", "ja": "ボクたちの後に、新人アイドルの子の収録があって……\nその子、次の仕事に間に合わないかもって言ってて。", "zh": "我们后面有个新人偶像要录影……\n那个女生说她下一个工作可能会迟到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "8f032d3299eb68327a2fe4f59146e895c091c89ded797d405d79df6f8da77691", "ja": "新人なのに穴を開けられないってすごく困ってたから、\n先に収録してもらったんです。", "zh": "她非常烦恼，说自己是新人不能出差错，\n所以我们就先让她录影了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "3e962c91be64801cd89c4d023b287d01c282f5bc4a77b81cdd7606115997a685", "ja": "そしたら、いろいろと押してしまって……ボクたちの\n収録、これからなんです。本当にすみません！", "zh": "结果发生很多事情耽误时间……\n所以我们现在才要开始录影。真的很对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "107607d8bec0f25d92afa226ea70f3277fc02d176f68cd90b3e10bf835a6f875", "ja": "今日は新曲の振り付けを教わる日だから、\n行かなくちゃいけないのはわかってたんだけどさ……。", "zh": "我们知道今天要学新歌的舞步，\n所以一定要去才行，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "118fbdac16605f6c54224567180da0e9d7c9bd6288c90c2c7ea314aefb9c7426", "ja": "いや、事情はわかった。真の判断は間違ってないよ。\nこっちは2人なしで頑張るから、心配しなくていい。", "zh": "没关系，状况我都明白了，真做出的判断没有错。\n我们这边其他人就先开始练，你们不用担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "96b89e630a5bf30d3019b5ea60d962f5dba3d2ce0a86033437948f807aa4a84d", "ja": "{$P$}……ありがとうございます！\nみんなにも、謝っておいてください！", "zh": "{$P$}……非常感谢你！\n请帮我们向大家道歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "17ab7a43a1855a6cd6347faece30ef477e48e13d46e73075dcd43c341faa50a7", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。ふたりとも、頑張ってこい！", "zh": "放心吧，你们也要好好加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b14c958e41f4f69c4af7d3cda32412ce5f03a0bd9fa66e7f9485d5232b1b90d8", "ja": "……とはいえ、真と歩が来られないのか。\nこれは少し、困ったことになったな……。", "zh": "……话是这么说，但真跟步来不了啊。\n这下可就有点伤脑筋了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a2b87d2356365dd5a3e25be526efef1698a3c250752c2f14ccbe6cdccad988dd", "ja": "え！？　ま、真ちゃん達が……。", "zh": "咦！？小、小真她们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "a1d89c775791a42cc910baffacdb8fb179d2a8cc4d3f1bc46a7405cc4ee8bbaa", "ja": "来られないんですかぁ～！？", "zh": "来不了吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "b9661f3f8931ad4786202452d7b1e855a8e5d9db24736ce8e66b8939e7de5431", "ja": "でも、そういう事情なら、仕方ないって思います。\nふたりとも、今日は私たちだけで頑張りましょうね。", "zh": "不过，遇上那种情况也没办法。\n你们两位，今天就我们几个一起努力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "fa25de6dfd26536857938ab1dea92868144cc08483ff2733fffd67c01f1c0678", "ja": "それで、みんなに相談したい事があるんだが……。", "zh": "另外，我有件事想跟你们商量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "15dde475450610808454926a0a674dd62972d3c470ee117581579676578f1ede", "ja": "ふえっ？\n{$P$}さんが、私たちに相談ですか？", "zh": "耶？\n{$P$}先生有事找我们商量？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "da58015ac7163795505af366b806c2cf606a4708752b91442928f6e78ed0a76c", "ja": "ああ。今日、振り付けの先生から教わった内容を、\n次のレッスンで真と歩に教えてほしいんだ。", "zh": "没错。我想拜托你们在下次训练时，\n把舞蹈老师今天教的内容教给真跟步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d8d207cb76956a9c9c94e4fe63a34e80a8c7a94d197755d08f1adfdfa023bdeb", "ja": "えっ？　わ、私たちが、振り付けを……\n真ちゃんと、歩ちゃんに……？", "zh": "咦？要、要我们把舞步……\n教给小真和小步……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "aa8e1f666939733d1b0235926895196ab6d79893a944677edc1d59c5b53c46e2", "ja": "振り付けの先生が忙しくてな。\n次に見てもらうのは、リハーサルになりそうなんだ。", "zh": "因为舞蹈老师非常忙，\n要等到下次排练时才能帮你们检查舞步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "31fc102cab99fafcdb4893401a98cb8451b642ea3c68f776e0b366ff4f19892e", "ja": "でも、それってつまり……まず私たちが、新しい\n振り付けを完璧に覚える、ってことですよね……？", "zh": "但是，这也就是说……\n我们要先完整记住新舞步，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1022_010azu", "source_sha256": "e2a271e7d1dbdeff7b92ffcd661891398a10f5a3a97ffbf72df3441132a59e5c", "ja": "まぁ、どうしましょう……\n頑張ってみますけど、私にできるかしら……。", "zh": "哎呀，怎么办……\n我会努力看看，但我做得到吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "934993bd49cbaed8e65172b473bb5ed6630a7b1e37cd6861ab00f227f70d5b86", "ja": "わ、私も……\nあんまり自信ないな～って……。", "zh": "我、我也是……\n感觉没什么自信耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "ac113d90a000fe838ef468b8c71fa434749bed090f21d971ffcfc2c2265ffc8c", "ja": "そうか……やっぱり振り付けの先生にお願いして、\n予定を調整してもらうしかないかな。", "zh": "这样啊……看来我还是只能拜托舞蹈老师，\n请老师调整一下行程了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "f7476795a99ed3e41d57f3e1d9711a93f6860c1bc0b166850fa054c5d40798ed", "ja": "真と歩は、ダンスレッスンへの合流が\n少し遅れる事になるけど……あのふたりなら大丈夫か。", "zh": "真跟步要晚点才能过来一起参加舞蹈训练……\n但那两个人应该不成问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1026_010azu", "source_sha256": "293c022a428011a913ce1a1b85855271fb73952b4ea49caca5f68417e12a34d4", "ja": "そうですね、そのほうがいいかもしれません。\n少し、時間はかかってしまいますけど……。", "zh": "说得也是，这样或许比较好。\n虽然会花上一点时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "792a2925a9eb04983b4810ddcf07af95ecda2829b619cd9dfedbebc77c9cffbf", "ja": "…………。\nあ、あの……、{$P$}？", "zh": "…………\n那、那个……{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1028_p", "source_sha256": "2adce47ad80a9b594f2cb133af9a37022fe974786943907e0ad4fc735bde70ef", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ、雪歩？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，雪步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1029_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7326497c5567f51e382834585805a7dcf1dacd67de51b1f09fef3f475d27bc1a", "ja": "わ、私が……。\n私が、真ちゃんたちの分まで、ダンスを覚えますぅ！", "zh": "我、我……\n我来学小真她们的舞步吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1031_010azu", "source_sha256": "4e531852b30ea4c1ab18aa7664f0919a6c6b42b72edd5ee6d9b93a526ff9d313", "ja": "雪歩ちゃん……？", "zh": "雪步……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1032_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f666e4d6690dbe30144f027d80c919f266b0df757b5a0cbc25ff308614cd0697", "ja": "も、もちろん、私なんかにはムリかもですけど……\n本当は、先生の予定を調整してもらったほうが……。", "zh": "虽、虽然，也许我根本学不会……\n或许拜托老师调整行程才是真正妥当的做法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1033_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bcbe26102bfd32d69c042d93d1ae8facdda0d968533fe4a549d44745a2bddb91", "ja": "でも、最初からあきらめるのは……違うかもって。\nだから、私にやらせてください！　お願いします！", "zh": "但我觉得一开始就放弃……好像不太对。\n所以，请让我来吧！拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "9a29766a3afc146e36e572e711dcaed85dfe24ad5285abf3959fb7f07f6362cf", "ja": "（雪歩……）", "zh": "（雪步……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1035_p", "source_sha256": "49b4c096ae061d40be4abccdf3e6d5e81819a1df3b335b3a7b30e222ec135114", "ja": "ありがとう、助かるよ。もし難しそうだったら、\n改めて調整を考えるという事で……頼んでもいいか？", "zh": "谢谢你，真是帮了大忙。要是实在有困难，\n到时候我们再想办法调整……那这件事能交给你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1036_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5ded298a5aee972ce86c2a7baeb5d1f44df1a33dacc6f1d04d3d9f545a4a28cd", "ja": "は、はいっ！\n私……決死の覚悟でがんばります～！", "zh": "好、好的！\n我……会抱着必死的觉悟加油～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1037_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1038_004yuk", "source_sha256": "99625947ecd11108ccd40c09b538e2f90052dd2b53ad078c2773c6e5147f3417", "ja": "1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8！\n……あ、あれ？　次は……。", "zh": "1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8！\n……奇、奇怪？接下来是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1039_010azu", "source_sha256": "98042c84c289077c044a9e68b19d0c553c9ac10b0ef23eb6a5e39c97040e791d", "ja": "雪歩ちゃん、次はそこでターンよ。", "zh": "雪步，接下来要在那里转圈喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1040_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6376b447440650c30e483991db3068a722422c61f9a0609add970ebb4001510e", "ja": "そ、そうでしたぁ！　あずささん、\nありがとうございます！　あ、あれ？　その次は……。", "zh": "我、我想起来了！阿梓姊，谢谢你！\n等、等等，再来是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1041_036kan", "source_sha256": "f71b60d66ad229096ff762b5e1fab3afe989068642e57004da73bcfd4dedef40", "ja": "雪歩さん、そこは止まって、右手を前です！\nピッと！", "zh": "雪步，再来要停住，右手放在前面！\n然后咻一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1042_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e0f239a6eaf0f1508954563e17ad0c48b582f7e3d46525e6f2a9793b85edd2fa", "ja": "ありがとう、可奈ちゃん！\nえっと、手を前にピッと……。", "zh": "谢谢你，可奈！\n呃，手放在前面咻一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1043_004yuk", "source_sha256": "53f82bc7de36c790d273efe54d73343a1400838db6e59f269c3a1b98cf63610b", "ja": "1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8！\n……こ、こんな感じだったと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8！\n……应、应该就像这样吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1044_006mak", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "哦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1045_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "哦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1046_036kan", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "哦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1047_010azu", "source_sha256": "5f279f107bf45e1b31e1fd3f7fa169c7ab0233bef6d62060f4c302883d5631a6", "ja": "まぁ……。", "zh": "哎呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1048_004yuk", "source_sha256": "06b28eb82c277411399b0a4431c557436df8be8a36790c9ad372adb14e4bc910", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい！　やっぱり\n私のダンスじゃ、全然伝わらなかったよね……？", "zh": "对、对不起！\n光靠我的舞蹈，果然完全无法理解吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1049_006mak", "source_sha256": "a72c57258ed76c5a9d015d9d701edfecae3131658ce9eb5d92f1d910b398e8a6", "ja": "ううん！　すごいよ、雪歩！　ムービーで見た\n先生のダンスとおんなじ、完璧じゃないか！", "zh": "不会呀！你真厉害，雪步！\n跟老师的示范影片一模一样，你跳得很完美嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1050_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5c237381d59d596c29d1d83c5c18211d40ea0d8bb9409877a2ea65f7b319dcb6", "ja": "生でしっかり見せてもらえたから、\n細かいところまでよくわかったよ！　グッジョブ！", "zh": "因为有你现场示范给我们看，\n所以连细节都一清二楚喔！Good Job！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1051_004yuk", "source_sha256": "391d8b49946c883ffca01022d9242c7199f1f74eabdcbb37f764f1021741cd3f", "ja": "……！\nっ、{$P$}……！", "zh": "……！\n唔，{$P$}……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1052_p", "source_sha256": "1449786f9d2e0ea04138e629ec7ea89624a21fae9023d6a393b8bf3aeb82e99c", "ja": "ああ、ふたりにも、きっちり伝わったみたいだ。\nよく頑張ったな、雪歩！", "zh": "嗯，她们两个似乎也彻底理解了。\n你非常努力呢，雪步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1053_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7fa9bde1342292a1f8412a54215687c58823dfdcb09144b48b8778d83fb0843b", "ja": "うぅ、ありがとうございます……。あずささんと\n可奈ちゃんのおかげで、何とかなりました……。", "zh": "呜呜，谢谢……多亏阿梓姊跟可奈，\n我才能勉强跳完……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1054_010azu", "source_sha256": "f0d8ecb30b707ccc7614c705cc5530ee7af00ef791bf818fb15641df351cc4d5", "ja": "私と可奈ちゃんは、少しお手伝いしただけよ。\nね、可奈ちゃん？", "zh": "我跟可奈只是稍微帮了一点忙。\n对吧，可奈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1055_036kan", "source_sha256": "a3ecd268531b1e61ce43684dcf9fc9b0350ef075a46527847c73b1c5f320054f", "ja": "はいっ！　雪歩さんの振り付け、バッチリでしたね！\nえへ、さすがです♪", "zh": "是啊！雪步的舞步非常完美！\n嘿嘿，真厉害♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1056_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8b23164ae4d038a788ac5fbdbbbf20510c0a2833829aa5eb00a3cc3171081714", "ja": "あずささん、可奈ちゃん……。", "zh": "阿梓姊、可奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1057_006mak", "source_sha256": "e89484f159e165fe6d9f313a446a4de92507d6d2830886b00a43b81149b333f1", "ja": "雪歩、あずささんも可奈も、本当にありがとう！\nよーし、じゃあ最初から全員でやってみようか！", "zh": "雪步、阿梓姊，还有可奈，真的很谢谢你们！\n好～那大家一起从头开始跳看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_03_1058_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
